Seattle closes out the preseason with the Oakland Raiders for the 14th-consecutive season, with four games taking place in Oakland and 10 in Seattle, including Week 4's match-up.
Single-game ticket information for preseason and regular season games will be announced following the regular season schedule announcement later this month.

