A proven business[ model]:[ The] Continuing Care Retirement[ Community] (CCRC) model has[ been][ a][ proven] success for more than 30 years. It has experienced substantial growth,[ irrespective][ of] setbacks in certain[ nic]hes of[ the] senior[-]living[ sector]. Due to[ the] large scale of these projects[,] there are significant[ barriers] to[ entry] from market to[ market]; consequently[,] the[ CC]RC model has not generally been overbuilt[,] and[ existing][ projects][ tend] to enjoy strong occupancy rates[.]
[S]QLC’s winning proposition for seniors: We[ offer] an extraordinarily active retirement lifestyle, with unique Life[ Care] services[.][ Therefore], we can[ provide] for our residents’ needs—from[ independent] living to assisted[ living][ to][ skilled][ nursing]—for the rest[ of][ their] lives[.]
